      "budget_share": 0.45,
      "why": "One result/cycle meets throughput>=32 Msps at modest Fmax. Registering every m stages trades FFs (area) against Fmax and batch latency; m is the key trade-off knob for the 0.44us p99 batch deadline, so this family spans the area-vs-latency curve the hypervolume rewards."
