      ],
      "budget_share": 0.35,
      "why": "Fully registered (m=1) gives the lowest latency per stage and the highest Fmax, so it most safely clears the 0.44us batch bound; it is the latency/throughput corner of the front. Costs more FFs than pipelined_m, so it anchors the high-accuracy/high-Fmax end of the trade-off."
    },
